# cursor-menu-leave (fix-cursor): leaving a theme row restores the default
# cursor. Clean Teal row centre probed at (1251,226), box [1112,208,278,36];
# (1116,95) is the Appearance title's left padding inside the open menu: no
# region, the menu stays open, the pointer never crosses the plane.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 500
move 1251 226
wait 300
move 1116 95
wait 300
shot cursor-menu-leave
